**Minors are strictly prohibited from using this software.**

### 2. Educational and Personal Use

This application is created for **educational and personal use only**. It
demonstrates modern Flutter development practices, including Clean
Architecture, BLoC state management, offline-first design, and performance
optimization.

It is intended as a learning resource for:

- Clean Architecture in Flutter
- BLoC / Cubit state management
- Advanced UI/UX implementation
- Offline-first mobile applications
- Web scraping and data management
- Performance optimization techniques

